    {
      "id": 151,
      "type": "Note",
      "pos": [
        -790,
        5080
      ],
      "size": [
        900,
        440
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 1,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "MiniMax H3 (W4A8) with the H3-Turbo Fast UNET Loader - text/image to video+audio, tuned for RTX 3050 6GB / 32GB RAM\n\nOnly change from the stock workflow: UNETLoader is replaced by H3-Turbo Fast UNET Loader (h3t).\n- Needs the custom node (H3-Turbo repo in custom_nodes) and the converted file in models/h3turbo/:\n  h3turbo h3-convert <...>_w4a8_convrot.safetensors <ComfyUI>/models/h3turbo/<...>_w4a8_convrot.h3t\n- attention = exact gives the same video as UNETLoader. int8_fast is about 22% faster at 832x480x124 but is a different sample (not bit-identical).\n- No run-time LoRAs on this loader (merge them into the checkpoint, or switch back to UNETLoader).\n- Short clips gain most; at 832x480x124 the exact mode is about the same speed as UNETLoader.\n\nModels\n- clip/qwen3vl-32B-MiniMax-H3-Q2_K.gguf (needs ComfyUI-GGUF)\n- vae/minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors + vae/minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors\n  download: https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/tree/main/vae\n\nSettings\n- 832x480, 124 frames (~5s @ 24fps), 8 steps res_multistep/simple.\n- Native canvas is 768 short edge (1344x768). Raise only if 832x480 runs fine - VRAM/time grow fast.\n- length snaps to 17k+5 frames: 73 (~3s), 124 (~5s), 175, 226...\n- First frame: select the Load Image node, Ctrl+B to un-bypass, pick your image.\n\nMemory: close Blender/Chrome/game launchers before queueing. First run is slow (HDD load)."
      ]
    }
  ],
